        "content": "Handles, faucet, and lighting should be installed last, after the big surfaces are set; small fixtures are quick wins that never block anyone.",
        "importance": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "project",
        "title": "Final Walk-Through",
        "content": "Keep a punch list for the final walk-through and walk the room with the installer and note every gap before final payment.",
        "importance": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "project",
